OL,3,GNEWSADormant park and ride scheme could
OL,4,Acost extra #14m
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoadworks to connect a new park and
OL,7,Fride, which has been left dormant for
OL,8,Ftwo years, with Oxford could cost #14m
OL,9,Fmore than anticipated.
OL,11,FAn Oxfordshire County Council scheme to
OL,12,Fimprove public transport and
OL,13,Fconnectivity along the A40 between
OL,14,FWitney and Oxford is set to begin next
OL,15,Fyear.
OL,17,FAs part of the project, the Eynsham
OL,18,Fpark and ride site was completed in
OL,19,F2024, but is not set to be linked to
OL,20,Fthe carriageway until summer 2028 at
OL,21,Fthe earliest.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
